{
  "about": "Invented comments on invented files, for the feedback text a Send carries. scripts/mobile/vectors-feedback.ts runs the window's own export over these (packages/inbox/attachments.ts attachmentFeedback) and its own makers of a code comment and a picture comment (codeCommentAnnotation, imageCommentAnnotation, codeHash; packages/inbox/markup.ts markupWords), and scripts/mobile/vectors.ts writes vectors/feedback.json. A case's `texts` are each file version's text, keyed `<attachment id>|<version>`; a record is the attachment, the version and the annotation, in the order the comments were made. None is a comment on a message's words, a guided review, a running app, a video's moment, a diagram's part or a quick label: the phone leaves those to the window.",
