      "texts": {
        "att_PLAN|current": "# Retry plan for the relay client\n\nStatus: **draft** · Owner: `relay` · Target: next release\n\n## Problem\n\nThe client drops its socket when the laptop sleeps and never comes back.\nIt retries at once, three times, then gives up.\n\n## Proposal\n\n1. Retry with a growing wait, capped at 60 seconds.\n2. Add jitter so a fleet does not retry in step.\n3. Stop after ten minutes and say so.\n\n- [x] Reproduce on a sleeping laptop\n- [ ] Ship behind a flag\n\n| Attempt | Wait |\n|---|---:|\n| 1 | 1 s |\n| 2 | 2 s |\n\n```ts\nconst wait = Math.min(60_000, 1000 * 2 ** tries)\nawait sleep(wait + jitter(250))\n```\n\n> Ten minutes is a guess.\n> Measure before the release.\n",
        "att_CODE|current": "import { jitter, sleep } from \"./time\"\n\nconst CAP_MS = 60_000\nconst GIVE_UP_MS = 10 * 60_000\n\nexport async function keepOpen(socket) {\n  let tries = 0\n  for (;;) {\n    await socket.open()\n    tries += 1\n    await sleep(Math.min(CAP_MS, 1000 * 2 ** tries) + jitter(250))\n  }\n}\n",
        "att_LOG|current": "09:14:01 DEBUG relay ping ok rtt=21 ms\n09:14:02 DEBUG relay ping ok rtt=22 ms\n# 09:14:03 INFO  relay opening again wait=8 s try=4\n09:14:04 WARN  relay socket closed code=1006\n",
        "att_NOTES|bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb": "---\ntitle: not front matter here\n---\nBody of the notes.\n\nA second paragraph.\n",
        "att_NOTES|current": "---\ntitle: not front matter here\n---\nBody of the notes.\n\nA second paragraph.\n"
      },
